    <string name="week_how">How is that counted?</string>
    <plurals name="week_baseline">
        <item quantity="one">Each decision counts as %1$d second. That is the median time it takes to do the same thing at the computer: switch to the window, read what the agent asked, decide, answer. It is an estimate, and it is the only assumption behind the number above.</item>
        <item quantity="other">Each decision counts as %1$d seconds. That is the median time it takes to do the same thing at the computer: switch to the window, read what the agent asked, decide, answer. It is an estimate, and it is the only assumption behind the number above.</item>
